Warning [jet.InferredNeverReturn]: Public function `fail` always diverges but does not declare `Never`
  --> inferred_never_return.jet:4:4
    |
  4 | fn fail(message: String) {
    |    ^^^^
 Why: Inferred divergence is useful to callers but is not part of the written API contract
 Fix: Write `-> Never` as the return type, for example `fn fail() -> Never`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L2421

